{"id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-wellorder.md","title":"可计算良序、索引与序型","display":"df-computable-wellorder — 可计算良序、索引与序型","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-wellorder","aliases":["20-df-computable-wellorder"],"display":"df-computable-wellorder — 可计算良序、索引与序型","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.hyperarithmetic","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"本地补充定义；Soare 2016 未建立该理论","depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-wellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-wellorder — 可计算良序、索引与序型"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.hyperarithmetic"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"本地补充定义；Soare 2016 未建立该理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D^2\">\\(R\\subseteq D^2\\)</span>；严格关系用前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x,y)\">\\(R(x,y)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=\\langle d,r\\rangle\">\\(e=\\langle d,r\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 是可计算良序的有效索引集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}\">\\(|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}\\)</span> 为其序型；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{idx}\">\\(\\mathrm{idx}\\)</span> 表示索引。\n上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nR\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ \\neg R(x,x)\\\\\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ [(R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow(R(x,y)\\lor R(y,x))]\\\\\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq D\\ [B\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\ \\forall c\\in B\\ (b=c\\lor R(b,c))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\land D\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle:\\exists D\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\exists R\\subseteq D^2\\\n[\\varphi_d=\\chi_D\\land\\varphi_r^{(2)}=\\chi_R\\land\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)]\\},\\\\\nD_e:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\varphi_{\\pi_1(e)}(x)\\downarrow=1\\},\\quad\nR_e:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_{\\pi_2(e)}^{(2)}(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\exists b:D\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\\n[R(x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow b(x)\\in b(y)]\\quad(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)),\\\\\n|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e,R_e)\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nR\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ \\neg R(x,x)\\\\\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ [(R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow(R(x,y)\\lor R(y,x))]\\\\\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq D\\ [B\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\ \\forall c\\in B\\ (b=c\\lor R(b,c))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\land D\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle:\\exists D\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\exists R\\subseteq D^2\\\n[\\varphi_d=\\chi_D\\land\\varphi_r^{(2)}=\\chi_R\\land\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)]\\},\\\\\nD_e:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\varphi_{\\pi_1(e)}(x)\\downarrow=1\\},\\quad\nR_e:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_{\\pi_2(e)}^{(2)}(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\exists b:D\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\\n[R(x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow b(x)\\in b(y)]\\quad(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)),\\\\\n|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e,R_e)\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格线序表示非自反、传递，并且不同元素恰有一个方向成立。外部非空子集量词表达真正良基性，不是只禁止可计算下降链。D 允许有限载体，否则会漏掉有限序数。otp 是与良序同构的唯一序数，由 ZFC 良序型定理给出。这是修复既有超算术条目所需的书外定义。</p>\n<p>来源：本地补充定义；Soare 2016 未建立该理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"R(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"e=\\langle d,r\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{idx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}wellorder}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nR\\subseteq D^2\\land\\forall x\\in D\\ \\neg R(x,x)\\\\\n\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in D\\ [(R(x,y)\\land R(y,z))\\Rightarrow R(x,z)]\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in D\\ [x\\ne y\\Rightarrow(R(x,y)\\lor R(y,x))]\\\\\n\\land\\forall B\\subseteq D\\ [B\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\ \\forall c\\in B\\ (b=c\\lor R(b,c))],\\\\\n\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)\\land D\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\chi_R\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}},\\\\\n\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}:=\\{\\langle d,r\\rangle:\\exists D\\subseteq\\omega\\ \\exists R\\subseteq D^2\\\n[\\varphi_d=\\chi_D\\land\\varphi_r^{(2)}=\\chi_R\\land\\operatorname{CWO}(D,R)]\\},\\\\\nD_e:=\\{x\\in\\omega:\\varphi_{\\pi_1(e)}(x)\\downarrow=1\\},\\quad\nR_e:=\\{(x,y)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_{\\pi_2(e)}^{(2)}(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{otp}(D,R)=\\alpha\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\exists b:D\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha\\ \\forall x,y\\in D\\\n[R(x,y)\\Longleftrightarrow b(x)\\in b(y)]\\quad(\\operatorname{WO}(D,R)),\\\\\n|e|_{\\mathrm{WO}}:=\\operatorname{otp}(D_e,R_e)\\quad(e\\in\\mathrm{WO}_{\\mathrm{idx}}).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2820,"backlinks":[{"id":"ee8677f552ac477b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]。"},{"id":"a6caa184e5759034","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-ck]]；see [[20-df-computable-wellorder]]；see [[20-df-anal]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-441","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-wellorder]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-441","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-wellorder]]"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","35073b74f84433b3","e343870c773cb68e"]}